{"ID":"20230928083843-zabbh0o","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20230928083843-zabbh0o","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928083843-zabbh0o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928083848-tkxxa33\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928084006-hh8r1c6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928083848-ptqwru7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:10,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:10\u0026#125;","title":"【正经】【足少阴肾经】","type":"doc","updated":"20240912173807"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240912165322-82abawa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240912165322-82abawa","updated":"20240912173800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【足少阴肾经穴位】：涌泉穴、然谷穴、太溪穴、大钟穴、水泉穴、照海穴、复溜穴、交信穴、筑宾穴、阴谷穴、横骨穴、大赫穴、气穴穴、四满穴、中注穴、肓俞穴、商曲穴、石关穴、阴都穴、通谷穴、幽门穴、步廊穴、神封穴、灵墟穴、神藏穴、彧中穴、俞府穴。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-tkxxa33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-tkxxa33","updated":"20230928083857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾主骨；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-srwmc10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-srwmc10","updated":"20230928083858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾其华在发；头发的光泽，就是肾的气色；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-6ebj7qk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-6ebj7qk","updated":"20230928083900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾开窍在耳；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-c7dxcr9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-c7dxcr9","updated":"20230928083859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾主记忆；人的肾气到1-50岁上升，50岁往后下降；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-7jy9fct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-7jy9fct","updated":"20230928083901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾要好，要节欲（欲望）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-ptqwru7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-ptqwru7","updated":"20230928083901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾是‘作强之官，伎巧出焉’；研发东西，思考，创新都靠肾脏；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-o460xgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-o460xgn","updated":"20230928083902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾主大小便；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-5p57hst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-5p57hst","updated":"20230928083903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾之音为‘羽’；发音为‘吹’；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-dgxddfi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-dgxddfi","updated":"20230928083904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾主唾；小肠火将大肠水蒸上肺在口中形成津液（唾液），吞下后入肾；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-uruw6de","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-uruw6de","updated":"20230928083905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"眼诊法：肾经位置，眼睛眼袋下方的位置；黯红色，红中带粉，代表肾脏已经受伤了；（水克火，火脏受伤显红色）；眼睛眼角内眦是诊断心脏的地方，眼白是肺；瞳孔是肾；瞳孔外一圈虹膜是土；再往外一圈角膜环是木；（因为肾是阴脏，所以灯光一照瞳孔会收缩，如灯光照灯光不动，说明肾阳虚掉了，如果瞳孔已经放大，说明肾气绝，死掉了）"}]},{"ID":"20230928083852-h15n542","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083852-h15n542"}},{"ID":"20230928083848-xy01bpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-xy01bpy","updated":"20230928083906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"井\t木\t涌泉穴\t子穴\t\t急救大穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-n86zt01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-n86zt01","updated":"20230928083907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"荣\t火\t然谷穴\t足太阴神经的郄穴\t急救大穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-zoq4ive","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-zoq4ive","updated":"20230928083907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"俞\t土\t太溪穴\t太溪穴脉在，说明肾气在；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-4re17te","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-4re17te","updated":"20230928083908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"经\t金\t复溜穴\t母穴\t\t该穴刺激很强，下针下去病人有麻电感"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-vmhulou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-vmhulou","updated":"20230928083909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"合\t水\t阴谷穴\t本穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928083922-bx9hk6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083922-bx9hk6i"}},{"ID":"20230928083848-douuo6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-douuo6c","updated":"20230928083927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"井穴为子穴时，泻井当泻荣，补井当补合；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-m9unjfh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-m9unjfh","updated":"20230928083927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大钟穴是足少阴肾经的络穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-h8ceo7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-h8ceo7e","updated":"20230928083928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"照海穴主阴跷脉，整个阴跷脉都归照海穴管；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-froplrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-froplrl","updated":"20230928083929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"交信穴是阴跷脉的郄穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-iemqj9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-iemqj9h","updated":"20230928083930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"筑宾穴是阴维脉的郄穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083848-kugklmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083848-kugklmi","updated":"20230928083930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"足少阴肾经，腹部的经络走向为任脉外开一寸；任脉外开两寸是足阳明胃经；所以肾经位于任脉与胃经中间；肾经在腹部的走向正好等于冲脉；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083931-l8qbgvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083931-l8qbgvd"}},{"ID":"20230928084000-47ewhcc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084000-47ewhcc","updated":"20230928084000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"足少阴肾经"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/足少阴肾经-20230928084000-f1tqzga.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928084003-ftrhu9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084003-ftrhu9t","updated":"20230928084003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"足少阴肾经1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/足少阴肾经1-20230928084003-4voqtyj.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928084006-hh8r1c6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084006-hh8r1c6","updated":"20230928084006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"足少阴肾经2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/足少阴肾经2-20230928084006-igz5yqd.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240912173806-za5b7t1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240912173806-za5b7t1"}},{"ID":"20240912173807-yk6jo57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240912173807-yk6jo57"}}]}